{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-5-17","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：比例","englishTitle":"If magnitudes be proportional componendo, they will also be proportional separando.","book":5,"number":17,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.17","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.17/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":17,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-5-17@raw-eb9de09ed6a2e6b5","contentId":"euclid-5-17","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eb9de09ed6a2e6b5fc61fb1262ea87be543dff57a7ff4f67282dde2b25edd0df","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-5-17.statement","euclid-5-17.construction.1","euclid-5-17.proof.1","euclid-5-17.proof.2","euclid-5-17.proof.3","euclid-5-17.proof.4","euclid-5-17.proof.5","euclid-5-17.proof.6","euclid-5-17.proof.7","euclid-5-17.proof.8","euclid-5-17.construction.2","euclid-5-17.proof.9","euclid-5-17.proof.10","euclid-5-17.proof.11","euclid-5-17.conclusion","euclid-5-17.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-5-17.statement","contentId":"euclid-5-17","revisionId":"euclid-5-17@raw-eb9de09ed6a2e6b5","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a2a9b8ad7fede484926a75b860a63575bfac0ced3ba52beab51fa7a1b2a3ccc7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If magnitudes be proportional componendo, they will also be proportional separando."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果量是成比例 合比,它们也将是成比例 分比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-17.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-5-17","revisionId":"euclid-5-17@raw-eb9de09ed6a2e6b5","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b2aa18f43b67915083b78f01a3ee19882cef525b879a8b2e02ffed8a15c3e909","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB, BE, CD, DF be magnitudes proportional componendo, so that, as AB is to BE, so is CD to DF; I say that they will also be proportional separando, that is, as AE is to EB, so is CF to DF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB,BE,CD,DF等同成比例等同,AB比BE等同CD比DF;我说,AE比EB等同CF比DF；AB 与 BE 之比等于 CD 与 DF 之比；AE 与 EB 之比等于 CF 与 DF 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-17.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-5-17","revisionId":"euclid-5-17@raw-eb9de09ed6a2e6b5","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6b8feea65a666becd9b8c39666ba2025d55aed3d5052ae29790cd8280b5663aa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For of AE, EB, CF, FD let equimultiples GH, HK, LM, MN be taken, and of EB, FD other, chance, equimultiples, KO, NP."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AE,EB,CF,FD,同倍数,GH,HK,LM,MN,EB,FD,其他机会,同倍数,KO,NP。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-17.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-5-17","revisionId":"euclid-5-17@raw-eb9de09ed6a2e6b5","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5a3544eb3b255d90c72cfc4445ba05ca9d979872a63a2033d6226b8b8a5ab3d6","citations":["euclid-5-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since GH is the same multiple of AE that HK is of EB, therefore GH is the same multiple of AE that GK is of AB. [[V. 1](/principles/euclid-5-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"GH是AE的乘数,HK是EB,GH是AE的乘数,GK是AB。 [[V. 1](/principles/euclid-5-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-17.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-5-17","revisionId":"euclid-5-17@raw-eb9de09ed6a2e6b5","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a84bc8093e5d4fd21910642b6a741d53dd98d088c0f61aa2f77ccbaeec2cdb5f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But GH is the same multiple of AE that LM is of CF; therefore GK is the same multiple of AB that LM is of CF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但GH是AE的乘数,LM是CF;因此,GK是AB的乘数,LM是CF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-17.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-5-17","revisionId":"euclid-5-17@raw-eb9de09ed6a2e6b5","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eac6e7ff1c70c8eae6f47ee8420f6ba85e054393f312a632622da3823cd697dc","citations":["euclid-5-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since LM is the same multiple of CF that MN is of FD, therefore LM is the same multiple of CF that LN is of CD. [[V. 1](/principles/euclid-5-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"再来LM是CF的乘数,MN是FD因此,LM是CF的乘数,LN是CD的乘数。 [[V. 1](/principles/euclid-5-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-17.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-5-17","revisionId":"euclid-5-17@raw-eb9de09ed6a2e6b5","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0a5c9b84011a19f3d77da4aaca9957f87776573d8df848e7645995537d1488b7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But LM was the same multiple of CF that GK is of AB; therefore GK is the same multiple of AB that LN is of CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但LM是CF的乘数,GK是AB;因此,GK是AB的乘数,LN是CD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-17.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-5-17","revisionId":"euclid-5-17@raw-eb9de09ed6a2e6b5","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"852af88294f7931ebe82d30b5541ac2304eab5f4497cabaff7a6fd33a7d25e84","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore GK, LN are equimultiples of AB, CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,GK,LN是AB,CD中的同倍数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-17.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-5-17","revisionId":"euclid-5-17@raw-eb9de09ed6a2e6b5","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f6baa9cdabb1e8fa7d415f97e77f8bece6215432efa9821acfdd4e25f87c08b4","citations":["euclid-5-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since HK is the same multiple of EB that MN is of FD, and KO is also the same multiple of EB that NP is of FD, therefore the sum HO is also the same multiple of EB that MP is of FD. [[V. 2](/principles/euclid-5-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,HK是EB的乘数,MN是FD,KO也是EB,NP是FD,HO也是EB,MP也是FD。 [[V. 2](/principles/euclid-5-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-17.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-5-17","revisionId":"euclid-5-17@raw-eb9de09ed6a2e6b5","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6bebe25caf9fcd7dc9f8ae1c44d049349452acde60cfb8483d7aaaa506701a0c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since, as AB is to BE, so is CD to DF, and of AB, CD equimultiples GK, LN have been taken, and of EB, FD equimultiples HO, MP, therefore, if GK is in excess of HO, LN is also in excess of MP, if equal, equal, and if less, less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB-BE的比等于CD-DF的比,AB、CD、同倍数、GK、LN的比,EB、FD、同倍数、MP的比,因此,如果GK超过HO,LN的比等于、等于或少于MP,则等于或少于MP；AB 与 BE 之比等于 CD 与 DF 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-17.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-5-17","revisionId":"euclid-5-17@raw-eb9de09ed6a2e6b5","order":10,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"10e4c8ffb265249b81854c289bb474c1da1ae8f11d0a87859e51ae857740fb55","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let GK be in excess of HO; then, if HK be subtracted from each, GH is also in excess of KO."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让GK超过HO;如果每人减去HK,则GH也超过KO。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-17.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-5-17","revisionId":"euclid-5-17@raw-eb9de09ed6a2e6b5","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bc46986816dc1881f12f89cb8ef59e17cdaf938000fa7483c0369c45c87eba97","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But we saw that, if GK was in excess of HO, LN was also in excess of MP; therefore LN is also in excess of MP, and, if MN be subtracted from each, LM is also in excess of NP; so that, if GH is in excess of KO, LM is also in excess of NP."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是我们看到,如果GK多报HO,LN多报MP,LN多报MP,如果每报MN,LM多报NP,GH多报KO,LM多报NP。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-17.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-5-17","revisionId":"euclid-5-17@raw-eb9de09ed6a2e6b5","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4d5db0a297c3f6945d60f87210b954d1681b5d02a1bcae781ab7946020305b03","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that, if GH be equal to KO, LM will also be equal to NP, and if less, less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,如果GH等于KO,LM等于NP,如果少于NP,则也等于更少。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-17.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-5-17","revisionId":"euclid-5-17@raw-eb9de09ed6a2e6b5","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c579c727d1cd8d9dcd6a631e1cee674ac6b7200fd8cbd3f84824ffea5732393b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And GH, LM are equimultiples of AE, CF, while KO, NP are other, chance, equimultiples of EB, FD; therefore, as AE is to EB, so is CF to FD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"GH,LM是AE,CF的同倍数,而KO,NP是另一个机会,EB,FD的同倍数;因此,AE对EB的比等于CF对FD的比；AE 与 EB 之比等于 CF 与 FD 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-17.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-5-17","revisionId":"euclid-5-17@raw-eb9de09ed6a2e6b5","order":14,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-17.source","contentId":"euclid-5-17","revisionId":"euclid-5-17@raw-eb9de09ed6a2e6b5","order":15,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4fb914cf3e66c3d812f6fd76f8f0e863d2dbaffc7db4677697bd008b2cd600b5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.17/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.17\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-5-17:euclid-5-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-17","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-17.proof.2","euclid-5-17.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.17","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.17/","sourceLabel":"V. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-5-17:euclid-5-2:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-17","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-17.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-2","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.17","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.17/","sourceLabel":"V. 2"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-5-18:euclid-5-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-18","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-18.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-17","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.18","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.18/","sourceLabel":"V. 17"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-5-19:euclid-5-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-19","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-19.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-17","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.19","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.19/","sourceLabel":"V. 17"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-14:euclid-5-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-14.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-17","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.14","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.14/","sourceLabel":"V. 17"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-112:euclid-5-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-112","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-112.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-17","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.112","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.112/","sourceLabel":"V. 17"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-5-17:euclid-5-1:explicit","id":"euclid-5-1","book":5,"number":1,"kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-5-17:euclid-5-2:explicit","id":"euclid-5-2","book":5,"number":2,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：比例论","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-5-18:euclid-5-17:explicit","id":"euclid-5-18","book":5,"number":18,"kind":"proposition","title":"分比与合比的转换","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-5-19:euclid-5-17:explicit","id":"euclid-5-19","book":5,"number":19,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：比例论","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-14:euclid-5-17:explicit","id":"euclid-10-14","book":10,"number":14,"kind":"proposition","title":"大小比较：可公度量与平方与比例","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-112:euclid-5-17:explicit","id":"euclid-10-112","book":10,"number":112,"kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：可公度量与截差无理线段与二项无理线段","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-ratio","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
